TRUMP'S ELECTION ITSELF WAS

00:07:26.395 --> 00:07:27.728
A STATEMENT AND A DESIRE

00:07:27.729 --> 00:07:29.163
THAT WE WANTED THINGS TO BE

00:07:29.164 --> 00:07:30.765
MORE CLEAR AND CONFRONTED.

00:07:30.766 --> 00:07:32.233
HE IS DOING THAT AND AS I

00:07:32.234 --> 00:07:33.534
HAVE NOTED THE IMPEACHMENT

00:07:33.535 --> 00:07:34.869
THE EFFORT FOR IMPEACHMENT

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:36.904
IS ALMOST NECESSARY IF WE

00:07:36.905 --> 00:07:39.273
WERE RIGHT IN 2016 THAT THIS

00:07:39.274 --> 00:07:40.541
WAS INEVITABLE AND NOW WE

00:07:40.542 --> 00:07:41.475
SEE HISTORIC LIVE THAT IT

00:07:41.476 --> 00:07:43.444
SEEMS TO HAVE BEEN EXPECTED

00:07:43.445 --> 00:07:45.414
AND ARRANGED FOR QUITE SOME

